    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "models/gemini-3-flash-preview"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Analyze the following lead based on their message and provide a lead\nscore with reasoning.\n\nLead Information:\nName: {{ $json.body.name }}\ncompany: {{ $json.body.company }}\nEmail:{{ $json.body.email }}\nMessage: {{ $json.body.message }}\n\nEvaluate the lead using these signals:\n- Buying intent (are they asking to buy/demo/discuss pricing, or just browsing?)\n- Urgency (do they mention a timeline or deadline?)\n- Authority (do they sound like a decision-maker — founder, VP, manager — or\n  an individual just researching?)\n- Budget clarity (is a budget mentioned or implied?)\n- Specificity (vague general interest vs. a clear, specific need)\n\nClassify the lead as exactly one of: \"hot\", \"warm\", or \"cold\".\n- hot: strong intent + urgency + authority/budget signals present\n- warm: genuine interest but missing intent, urgency, or authority signals\n- cold: no real intent, vague inquiry, or clearly not a sales-ready lead\n\nRespond with ONLY a valid JSON object, no markdown, no extra text, in\nexactly this format:\n\n{\n  \"reasoning\": \"<1-2 sentence explanation citing specific signals from the message>\",\n  \"lead_category\": \"hot\" | \"warm\" | \"cold\",\n  \"lead_score\": \"hot=80 to 100\"|\"warm=50 to 80\"|\"cold=20to50\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "content": "={{ $json.body.name }}{{ $json.body.company }}{{ $json.body.email }}{{ $json.body.phone }}{{ $json.body.message }}{{ $json.body.budget }}{{ $json.body.source }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -624,
        224
      ],
      "id": "690e75c0-83be-4564-972c-e8dfc0200800",
      "name": "gemi",
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "hq4xocHcg17JIdBT",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Lead data from Webhook\nconst lead = $('lead').first().json.body;\n\n// Gemini output\nconst aiJson = $input.first().json;\n\n// Try multiple possible Gemini response formats\nconst aiRaw =\n    aiJson.content?.parts?.[0]?.text ||\n    aiJson.message?.content ||\n    aiJson.message?.text ||\n    aiJson.text ||\n    aiJson.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts?.[0]?.text ||\n    aiJson.choices?.[0]?.message?.content ||\n    '';\n\n// Convert JSON string into object\nconst ai = JSON.parse(aiRaw);\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    name: lead.name,\n    email: lead.email,\n    company: lead.company,\n    budget: lead.budget,\n    message: lead.message,\n    phone: lead.phone,\n\n    lead_category: ai.lead_category,\n    lead_score: Number(ai.lead_score),\n    reasoning: ai.reasoning\n  }\n}];"
      },
